    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Shooter: the fast-paced arena FPS where the rules change every game! Mod Shooter is an arena FPS with <strong>modifiers</strong>, <strong>pickups</strong>, <strong>dynamic maps</strong>, <strong>various</strong> <strong>guns</strong>, and <strong>multiple</strong>\u00a0<strong>game modes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the boomer shooters + arena shooters of the past, as well as LAN parties with custom lobbies, Mod Shooter changes the rules of the game every round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bringing The Arena Shooter Back To Its Roots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across multiple dynamic maps and game modes, modifiers will fundamentally shape how you play each game of Mod Shooter. No two games will ever be the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more control? The host can also manually modify the game settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/extras/d3abd346565e433c83e150dd8c3f052d.avif?t=1755219486\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features (With More Being Added!)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Game Modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Unlockable Characters -- <i>no microtransactions!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thousands </i>of Unique Game Combinations!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that there is currently no public matchmaking, and only private invite-only lobbies are supported. Bots can be toggled at any time in coop game modes or to fill out the lobbies up to the recommended number of players for each map. Public lobbies and matchmaking may possibly be added in a future update.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Shooter: the fast-paced arena FPS where the rules change every game! Mod Shooter is an arena FPS with <strong>modifiers</strong>, <strong>pickups</strong>, <strong>dynamic maps</strong>, <strong>various</strong> <strong>guns</strong>, and <strong>multiple</strong>\u00a0<strong>game modes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the boomer shooters + arena shooters of the past, as well as LAN parties with custom lobbies, Mod Shooter changes the rules of the game every round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bringing The Arena Shooter Back To Its Roots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across multiple dynamic maps and game modes, modifiers will fundamentally shape how you play each game of Mod Shooter. No two games will ever be the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more control? The host can also manually modify the game settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/extras/d3abd346565e433c83e150dd8c3f052d.avif?t=1755219486\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features (With More Being Added!)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Game Modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Unlockable Characters -- <i>no microtransactions!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thousands </i>of Unique Game Combinations!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that there is currently no public matchmaking, and only private invite-only lobbies are supported. Bots can be toggled at any time in coop game modes or to fill out the lobbies up to the recommended number of players for each map. Public lobbies and matchmaking may possibly be added in a future update.</p>",
    "short_description": "A chaotic multiplayer arena FPS with various guns, pickups, and modifiers across multiple game modes and dynamic maps. No two games will ever be the same!",
